</style>
<h2>Asobi 0.8 (build 683)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Personal links for web reviews.</b> Under the share link in the Shared Review panel, type a name and press Add: that person gets their own short link. They are never asked who they are &#8212; the name is signed by your Mac, so nobody can borrow it &#8212; and the panel shows who has opened theirs, who is here now, and when a link has been opened in more than one browser.</li>
<li><b>Withdraw one person without ending the review.</b> Withdraw takes them out of the room straight away and refuses their link from then on; Restore lets the same link work again. (It can&#8217;t take back what someone has already seen.)</li>
<li>The ordinary link keeps working exactly as before for anyone who has it. &#8220;Invited people only&#8221; is coming next.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
