<h2>Asobi 0.8 (build 669)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Fixed a crash during shared reviews.</b> Changing clips while the review was playing &#8212; which guests on the web do all the time &#8212; could quit the app, because audio was started on a clip that had not finished loading. Audio now waits for the clip and starts the moment it is ready.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
